361
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,540
你认为他是希望
Do you think

362
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:12,720
一直维持这种关系
he's perpetuating that relationship

363
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,510
才会找野蛮女友当伴侣的吗
by seeking out a partner like you?

364
00:15:16,860 --> 00:15:20,250
我以前总是穿无袖背心
You know, I used to wear tank tops a lot.

365
00:15:20,250 --> 00:15:22,520
这个卖点非常吸引顾客
That was a big selling point.

366
00:15:25,190 --> 00:15:26,880
谢尔顿  怎么了
Hi, Sheldon. What's up?

367
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:30,190
好消息  你是颗行星了
Good news. You're an asteroid.

368
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:35,750
请你告诉我这句该怎么接
Uh... please tell me what to say next.

369
00:15:37,030 --> 00:15:38,400
看来我得解释一下
Perhaps I should explain.

370
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,080
在跟库萨帕里一起工作的时候
While working with Koothrappali,

371
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:42,040
我们发现了一颗小行星
we discovered an asteroid,

372
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,850
我以你的名字给它命名了
and I named it after you.

373
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,480
谢尔顿  谢谢你
Sheldon, thank you.

374
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,560
这太浪漫了
That's so romantic.

375
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:51,220
那拉杰什怎么办
But what about Rajesh?

376
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:53,140
他同意让你用这名字吗
He was okay with you choosing the name?

377
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:54,900
确实花了一些时间磋商
Well, it took a little negotiating,

378
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,050
最后我将他说服了
but I wore him down.

379
00:15:56,050 --> 00:15:57,480
小行星的命名权给我们
Uh, we get the asteroid,

380
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:59,380
但如果我们生了孩子
and if you and I have children,

381
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:02,010
都得取名叫拉杰什
they all have to be named Rajesh.

382
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:05,210
全都要叫这名吗
All of them?

383
00:16:05,210 --> 00:16:06,990
连女儿都要
Even the girls.

384
00:16:09,050 --> 00:16:11,490
好吧 我知道现在该说什么了
Okay, I think I know what to say now.

385
00:16:13,810 --> 00:16:15,170
当我们的卧室
How can I not sound like his mother

386
00:16:15,170 --> 00:16:17,520
被星战玩具塞满  我怎么可能不变身他妈
when our entire bedroom is filled with Star Wars toys?

387
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,490
你跟人上床的时候
I mean, have you ever had sex

388
00:16:18,490 --> 00:16:21,140
有试过被伍基人毛绒玩具盯着看吗
with a stuffed Wookiee watching you?

389
00:16:21,850 --> 00:16:23,440
我念大学的时候是七十年代
I went to college in the '70s;

390
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,470
那时候大家都不刮毛
it was a hairier time.

391
00:16:24,470 --> 00:16:26,310
所以我的答案是 是的
I'm gonna say yes.

392
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:29,590
就算我像他妈  也是被他逼的
You know, if anything, he's turning me into his mother.

393
00:16:29,590 --> 00:16:32,190
我当医药销售之前是个演员
Before I did pharmaceutical sales, I was an actress.

394
00:16:32,190 --> 00:16:33,720
相当优秀的演员
You know, I was pretty good.

395
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,880
那种邻家女孩型  但很性感
You know, girl-next-door type, but hot.

396
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,890
有"搞"头那种
Doable.

397
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,390
我不仅成了莱纳德的妈
And not only am I Leonard's mother,

398
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:44,520
还有这个老小孩跟我们一起住  叫谢尔顿
but we have this man-child living with us named Sheldon.

399
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:47,250
莱纳德确实说过他很多事
Oh, Leonard talked a lot about him.

400
00:16:47,490 --> 00:16:49,800
我之前不确定他是否真实存在
I wasn't sure if he was real.

401
