你烦心事真是够多啊
Wow, you really do have a lot on your plate.

404
00:17:00,250 --> 00:17:01,790
是的
I do.

405
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:04,490
说真的   莱纳德说得对
You know, Leonard's right.

406
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:06,280
跟你聊天特别有帮助
Talking to you is really helping.

407
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,590
很高兴能帮上忙
Oh, I'm glad.

408
